{"seq":1,"slug":"http-lifecycle","title":"HTTP 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/networking/http-lifecycle","wordCount":648,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"http-生命周期\">HTTP 生命周期</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一次 HTTP 请求从 URL 到响应依次经过 <strong>DNS → TCP → TLS → HTTP</strong> 四个阶段。DNS 解析依赖多级缓存逐层回退；TLS 1.3 将握手压缩到 <strong>1-RTT</strong> 并支持 0-RTT 恢复；应用层由 HTTP/2 的多路复用与头部压缩演进到基于 <strong>QUIC</strong> 的 HTTP/3，彻底消除队头阻塞。各阶段耗时可用 <code>PerformanceResourceTiming</code> 精确测量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-url-到响应\">从 URL 到响应</h2><p>当用户在地址栏输入一个 URL 并按下回车，浏览器会经过一系列网络步骤获取资源。整个过程称为 <strong>HTTP 请求生命周期</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    URL[&quot;输入 URL&quot;] --&gt; DNS[&quot;DNS 解析&quot;]&#10;    DNS --&gt; TCP[&quot;TCP 连接&quot;]&#10;    TCP --&gt; TLS[&quot;TLS 握手&quot;]&#10;    TLS --&gt; HTTP[&quot;HTTP 请求/响应&quot;]&#10;    HTTP --&gt; Parse[&quot;解析响应&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    URL[\"输入 URL\"] --&gt; DNS[\"DNS 解析\"]\n    DNS --&gt; TCP[\"TCP 连接\"]\n    TCP --&gt; TLS[\"TLS 握手\"]\n    TLS --&gt; HTTP[\"HTTP 请求/响应\"]\n    HTTP --&gt; Parse[\"解析响应\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dns-解析\">DNS 解析</h2><p>DNS（Domain Name System）将域名解析为 IP 地址。浏览器会按以下顺序查找：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Query[&quot;DNS 查询: example.com&quot;]&#10;    Query --&gt; BrowserCache[&quot;1. 浏览器 DNS 缓存&quot;]&#10;    BrowserCache --&gt;|未命中| OSCache[&quot;2. 操作系统 DNS 缓存&quot;]&#10;    OSCache --&gt;|未命中| Router[&quot;3. 路由器缓存&quot;]&#10;    Router --&gt;|未命中| ISP[&quot;4. ISP DNS 服务器&quot;]&#10;    ISP --&gt;|未命中| Recursive[&quot;5. 递归查询&quot;]&#10;    Recursive --&gt; Root[&quot;根 DNS 服务器&quot;]&#10;    Root --&gt; TLD[&quot;顶级域 DNS (.com)&quot;]&#10;    TLD --&gt; Auth[&quot;权威 DNS 服务器&quot;]&#10;    Auth --&gt;|返回 IP| Result[&quot;93.184.216.34&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Query[\"DNS 查询: example.com\"]\n    Query --&gt; BrowserCache[\"1. 浏览器 DNS 缓存\"]\n    BrowserCache --&gt;|未命中| OSCache[\"2. 操作系统 DNS 缓存\"]\n    OSCache --&gt;|未命中| Router[\"3. 路由器缓存\"]\n    Router --&gt;|未命中| ISP[\"4. ISP DNS 服务器\"]\n    ISP --&gt;|未命中| Recursive[\"5. 递归查询\"]\n    Recursive --&gt; Root[\"根 DNS 服务器\"]\n    Root --&gt; TLD[\"顶级域 DNS (.com)\"]\n    TLD --&gt; Auth[\"权威 DNS 服务器\"]\n    Auth --&gt;|返回 IP| Result[\"93.184.216.34\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function measureDNS(url: string): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  const entries = performance.getEntriesByType(&#39;navigation&#39;) as PerformanceNavigationTiming[];&#10;  if (entries.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const nav = entries[0];&#10;    console.log(`DNS lookup: ${nav.domainLookupEnd - nav.domainLookupStart}ms`);&#10;    console.log(`TCP connect: ${nav.connectEnd - nav.connectStart}ms`);&#10;    console.log(`TLS handshake: ${nav.connectEnd - nav.secureConnectionStart}ms`);&#10;    console.log(`TTFB: ${nav.responseStart - nav.requestStart}ms`);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;measureDNS(location.href);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measureDNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntriesByType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'navigation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PerformanceNavigationTiming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nav</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> entries[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`DNS lookup: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">domainLookupEnd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">domainLookupStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`TCP connect: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connectEnd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connectStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`TLS handshake: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connectEnd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">secureConnectionStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`TTFB: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">responseStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nav</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">requestStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measureDNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(location.href);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"tcp-三次握手\">TCP 三次握手</h2><p>TCP（Transmission Control Protocol）建立可靠连接需要三次握手：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client as 客户端&#10;    participant Server as 服务器&#10;&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: SYN (seq=x)&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: SYN-ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1)&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: ACK (ack=y+1)&#10;    Note over Client,Server: 连接建立,开始传输数据\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as 客户端\n    participant Server as 服务器\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: SYN (seq=x)\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: SYN-ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1)\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: ACK (ack=y+1)\n    Note over Client,Server: 连接建立,开始传输数据</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一次</td>\n<td>客户端→服务器</td>\n<td>SYN</td>\n<td>请求建立连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二次</td>\n<td>服务器→客户端</td>\n<td>SYN+ACK</td>\n<td>确认并同意连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三次</td>\n<td>客户端→服务器</td>\n<td>ACK</td>\n<td>确认收到同意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tls-握手\">TLS 握手</h2><p>HTTPS 在 TCP 之上添加 TLS（Transport Layer Security）加密层。TLS 1.3 将握手减少到一次往返：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client as 客户端&#10;    participant Server as 服务器&#10;&#10;    Note over Client,Server: TLS 1.3 握手 (1-RTT)&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: ClientHello + Key Share&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: ServerHello + Key Share + 证书 + Finished&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: Finished&#10;    Note over Client,Server: 加密通道建立\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as 客户端\n    participant Server as 服务器\n\n    Note over Client,Server: TLS 1.3 握手 (1-RTT)\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: ClientHello + Key Share\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: ServerHello + Key Share + 证书 + Finished\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: Finished\n    Note over Client,Server: 加密通道建立</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>TLS 版本</th>\n<th>握手往返次数</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TLS 1.2</td>\n<td>2-RTT</td>\n<td>兼容性好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 1.3</td>\n<td>1-RTT</td>\n<td>更快更安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TLS 1.3 (0-RTT)</td>\n<td>0-RTT（恢复会话）</td>\n<td>最快但有重放风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"http-1-1-vs-http-2-vs-http-3\">HTTP/1.1 vs HTTP/2 vs HTTP/3</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph H1[&quot;HTTP/1.1&quot;]&#10;        H1R1[&quot;请求 1&quot;] --&gt; H1S1[&quot;响应 1&quot;]&#10;        H1S1 --&gt; H1R2[&quot;请求 2&quot;]&#10;        H1R2 --&gt; H1S2[&quot;响应 2&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph H2[&quot;HTTP/2&quot;]&#10;        H2Stream1[&quot;流 1: 请求+响应&quot;]&#10;        H2Stream2[&quot;流 2: 请求+响应&quot;]&#10;        H2Stream3[&quot;流 3: 请求+响应&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph H3[&quot;HTTP/3 (QUIC)&quot;]&#10;        H3Stream1[&quot;QUIC 流 1&quot;]&#10;        H3Stream2[&quot;QUIC 流 2&quot;]&#10;        H3Stream3[&quot;QUIC 流 3&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph H1[\"HTTP/1.1\"]\n        H1R1[\"请求 1\"] --&gt; H1S1[\"响应 1\"]\n        H1S1 --&gt; H1R2[\"请求 2\"]\n        H1R2 --&gt; H1S2[\"响应 2\"]\n    end\n    subgraph H2[\"HTTP/2\"]\n        H2Stream1[\"流 1: 请求+响应\"]\n        H2Stream2[\"流 2: 请求+响应\"]\n        H2Stream3[\"流 3: 请求+响应\"]\n    end\n    subgraph H3[\"HTTP/3 (QUIC)\"]\n        H3Stream1[\"QUIC 流 1\"]\n        H3Stream2[\"QUIC 流 2\"]\n        H3Stream3[\"QUIC 流 3\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>HTTP/1.1</th>\n<th>HTTP/2</th>\n<th>HTTP/3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输层</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>TCP</td>\n<td>QUIC (UDP)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多路复用</td>\n<td>否（管线化已弃用）</td>\n<td>是（单 TCP 连接）</td>\n<td>是（独立 QUIC 流）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头部压缩</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>HPACK</td>\n<td>QPACK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务器推送</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>队头阻塞</td>\n<td>应用层 + 传输层</td>\n<td>仅传输层</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接建立</td>\n<td>TCP + TLS (3-RTT)</td>\n<td>TCP + TLS (3-RTT)</td>\n<td>QUIC (1-RTT)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function checkHTTPVersion(url: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(url);&#10;  const entries = performance.getEntriesByName(url) as PerformanceResourceTiming[];&#10;&#10;  if (entries.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const entry = entries[entries.length - 1];&#10;    console.log(`Protocol: ${entry.nextHopProtocol}`);&#10;    console.log(`Transfer size: ${entry.transferSize} bytes`);&#10;    console.log(`Encoded body size: ${entry.encodedBodySize} bytes`);&#10;    return entry.nextHopProtocol;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkHTTPVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">url</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> entries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntriesByName</span><span style=\"c