\">({ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'resource'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, buffered: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Chrome DevTools 的 Network 面板中，&quot;Protocol&quot; 列显示每个请求使用的协议版本（h2 = HTTP/2，h3 = HTTP/3）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>HTTP 请求经历 <strong>DNS → TCP → TLS → HTTP</strong> 四个阶段</li>\n<li>DNS 解析通过多级缓存加速，使用 <code>dns-prefetch</code> 可预解析域名</li>\n<li>TLS 1.3 将握手减少到 <strong>1-RTT</strong>，支持 0-RTT 会话恢复</li>\n<li>HTTP/2 引入多路复用和头部压缩，HTTP/3 基于 <strong>QUIC</strong> 彻底消除队头阻塞</li>\n<li>使用 <code>PerformanceResourceTiming</code> API 可以精确测量每个阶段的耗时</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"HTTP 生命周期","id":"http-生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从 URL 到响应","id":"从-url-到响应"},{"level":2,"text":"DNS 解析","id":"dns-解析"},{"level":2,"text":"TCP 三次握手","id":"tcp-三次握手"},{"level":2,"text":"TLS 握手","id":"tls-握手"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP/1.1 vs HTTP/2 vs HTTP/3","id":"http-1-1-vs-http-2-vs-http-3"},{"level":2,"text":"QUIC 协议","id":"quic-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/dom-and-cssom/compositing"},"next":{"title":"资源加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/browser-and-web-api/networking/resource-loading"}}